{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09666","headline":"临河客舍呈狄明府兄留题县南楼 · 岑参","name":"临河客舍呈狄明府兄留题县南楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黎阳城南雪正飞，黎阳渡头人未归。\n河边酒家堪寄宿，主人小女能缝衣。\n故人高卧黎阳县，一别三年不相见。\n邑中雨雪偏着时，隔河东郡人遥羡。\n邺都唯见古时丘，漳水还如旧日流。\n城上望乡应不见，朝来好是嬾登楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09666.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09666","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}